      "My Holiday",
      "",
      "My holiday activities are very simple.",
      "Because I'm usually very tired from work, I like to relax on holidays.",
      "After getting up in the morning, I usually drink some coffee while reading the newspaper.",
      "For lunch, I make some tasty food.",
      "In the afternoon, I go running or play soccer.",
